waymo,2026-06,20500000,280450000,270537269,290362731,17255400,23744600,1.0,1,1,1,"US est.: extrapolated from the 220.6M end-Mar-2026 anchor but held ~flat vs May: ALL US freeway rides suspended May 21 through end of Jun (construction-zone/flood software fixes; resumed Jul 29 from Phoenix), offsetting underlying growth (~3,500 cars; Nashville public Jun 25; Atlanta's flood-pause of May 20 ended May 27-28; Jul-8 new-city launches not yet material); ±30% CPUC Q2-2026 (posted Aug 18, 2026) CA driverless actuals: 9,023,791 deployment + 660,877 pilot = 9,684,668 mi this month (TotalVMTZEV, all three periods incl. deadhead), so ~47% of the estimate is now regulator-measured rather than modeled; the +/-30% modeling band is applied to the non-California remainder only."
