tesla,2026-07,170000,2610000,2421800,3146000,55000,340000,1.0,0.1074,0.0434,1.0,"Extension month beyond the Q2-2026 deck chart (2.440M cume end-Jun; next anchor ~late-Oct Q3 deck): central held near the May-Jun run-rate. No independent July estimate exists (robotaxitracker retired its mileage model Aug 2026; late-Jul press 'nearly 2.5M' merely restates the deck's 2.44M end-Jun). Band from the deck series' own MoM volatility (9 ratios Sep-25..Jun-26, log-sd 0.34, ~95% one-step band [84k, 324k] from June's 157k): floor 55k sits below the worst-ever 0.51x month, ceiling 340k (2.2x, vs best-ever 1.48x and Tesla's '>10%/wk' claim compounding to ~200k) covers the July launch ramp (Miami driverless Jul 3, Tampa/Orlando Jul 21; six metros, TX+FL). Same scope as the deck series (fleet service miles incl. deadhead)."
